Barlow Crane is an elf of the [[Geography/Istria/Iomenei/Undercroft|Undercroft]] in [[Geography/Istria/Iomenei/index|Iomenei]], the oldest elf anyone has met: his dark elf's purple skin has faded to pale amethyst, his silver hair is swept back, and he wears a bushy silver handlebar mustache. He dresses in workman's overalls stuffed with tools, wears a great padded shield on his back, and carries a club ringed with the teeth and claws of monsters he has killed. His job is to kill whatever gets into the Undercroft that should not be there, big rats and big cockroaches.

Barlow can read the emotions left on a thing and see the face of whoever left them; that is how the saboteur [[People/Gerhard|Gerhard]] was identified. He frightens people easily, and the sector foreman who let that sabotage happen fled rather than face execution. Red lightning runs along his club when he fights. He killed the [[Bestiary/Vermin|Hivemother]], splitting it in two.
